flowchart LR
    A[PPO Policy] --> B[VPP Offset a_RL]
    B --> C{CBF QP Filter}
    C -->|safe| D[Use a_RL]
    C -->|unsafe| E[Solve QP / Fallback]
    E --> F[Use a_filtered]
    D --> G[VirtualPointGenerator]
    F --> G
    G --> H[LOSRateGuidance]
    H --> I[Command Clip / Filter]
    I --> J[ActuatorDynamics]
    J --> K[LowLevelController]
    K --> L[JSBSim F-16 Dynamics]
    L --> M[State x]
    M --> C

    subgraph CBF_Input
        N[pursuer position p_o]
        O[pursuer velocity v_o]
        P[target position p_t]
        Q[target velocity v_t]
    end

    N --> C
    O --> C
    P --> C
    Q --> C

    style C fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style E fill:#ff9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
